    "description": {
      "value": "<p>By 13th level, your physical form is nourished directly by the internal biocircuits of the Source:</p><ul><li>You no longer require <strong>food or water</strong> to survive.</li><li>You can survive without air in hard vacuum, underwater, or within toxic atmospheres for a number of hours equal to your <strong>Charisma modifier</strong> (minimum 1 hour).</li><li>You are <strong>immune to biological and supernatural aging</strong>, and cannot be aged magically.</li><li>You require only <strong>4 hours of restful meditation</strong> to gain the full benefits of a Long Rest.</li></ul>"
